reasonably be expected to result in a Material Adverse Effect. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(m)&#8195;<U>Conduct of Business; Regulatory Permits</U>.
