&#147;accredited investor&#148; as defined in Rule 501(a) under the Securities Act or a qualified institutional buyer as defined in Rule 144A under the Securities Act. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(f)&#8195;<U>General Solicitation</U>. Such Purchaser is not purchasing the Securities as a result of any advertisement,
