<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(b)&#8195;<U>Legends</U>. Certificates and book-entry statements evidencing the Securities shall bear, any legend as required
