<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Pursuant to <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;2.3(b)</U> of the Agreement, please provide us with the following information: </P>
